// RUN: zkc-run %S/Inputs/statement-verdict-precedence.mlir --vectors %S/Inputs/statement-verdict-precedence-vectors.json | FileCheck %s
//
// A statement value that fails to bind is already the verdict
// (endpoints.md §4); no later program step may overwrite it. The
// hand-crafted artifact reads from the (empty) proof stream before
// its transcript_init, so a masked verdict would surface as
// abi_decode_failure here instead. Hand-authored vectors — the
// artifact is adversarial, so there is no oracle prover to
// regenerate them from.
//
// CHECK: out_of_range_statement: public_binding_failure []
